Every time you visit a website, Privacy Advisor automatically analyses its privacy policy and shows you a simple risk rating no legal knowledge required.

What it does:

Shows a colour-coded verdict (🔵 Exemplary → 🔴 Avoid) for every site you visit
Breaks down 6 key factors: data collection, consent clarity, opt-out effectiveness, track record, third-party sharing, and key risks
Tells you what you're actually agreeing to, what your rights are, and the company's regulatory history
Personalised for your region (US, EU/UK, India, China) and user type (Adult, Teen, Child)

Privacy first:
All analysis runs entirely on your device. No data is sent to any server. No tracking. No ads.
⚠️ This tool is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.
Built entirely using Claude AI. 
